MODULE: TypeOKStorageSettlementOutsideDomain
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: storage completion fabricates a foreign outstanding caller
PERTURBS: StorageSettle

--- FIND
    /\ outstanding' = outstanding \ {c}
--- REPLACE
    /\ outstanding' = (outstanding \ {c}) \cup {99} \* MUTATION: foreign caller.
--- END
